       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-RAG-GFM.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RAG-GFM-PROOFS.
           05  WS-RETRIEVAL-MUTUAL-INFO-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CROSS-ATTENTION-STABILITY PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GRAPH-TOPOLOGY-PRESERVE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GENERALIZED-FLOW-MATCH   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RAG-GFM-SOVEREIGN-SEAL   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-RAG-GFM-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-RAG-GFM-PROVEN       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-RAG-GFM-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-RETRIEVAL-AND-ATTENTION.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-GRAPH-AND-FLOW.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-RAG-GFM-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-RETRIEVAL-AND-ATTENTION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RETRIEVAL-MUTUAL-INFO-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CROSS-ATTENTION-STABILITY.
       2000-EVALUATE-GRAPH-AND-FLOW.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GRAPH-TOPOLOGY-PRESERVE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GENERALIZED-FLOW-MATCH.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-RAG-GFM-PROOFS.
           IF WS-RETRIEVAL-MUTUAL-INFO-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CROSS-ATTENTION-STABILITY = 1 AND
              WS-GRAPH-TOPOLOGY-PRESERVE = 1 AND
              WS-GENERALIZED-FLOW-MATCH = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-RAG-GFM-SOVEREIGN-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-RAG-GFM-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-RAG-GFM-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-RAG-GFM-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-RAG-GFM-CODE.
